// src: A = AAGBI 2012 \u00B7 K = Klein 2021 \u00B7 W = WHO 2008 \u00B7 D = DAS 2025 \u00B7 M = EMHG 2020 \u00B7 L = AAGBI LAST 2010 \u00B7 practice = clinical practice
